    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for computing probabilities related to edible prey decisions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class manages probability functions for predator-prey interactions where the prey is an edible resource. It allows multiple probability functions to be applied and a remaining function for unassigned indices. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
